  ok: the constructor arrays ran in order before main
  ok: raise and handle in one frame
  ok: an exception propagates through 5 frames
  ok: the code after the raising call did not run
  ok: Exception_Name is the full name
  ok: Exception_Message
  ok: Exception_Information has the name and the message
  ok: raise; propagates the same occurrence
  ok: Reraise_Occurrence of a saved occurrence
  ok: division by zero raises Constraint_Error
  ok: a range check raises Constraint_Error
  ok: Program_Error with a message
  ok: controlled objects are finalized in reverse order during propagation
  ok: without an exception the same code finalizes normally
  ok: an exception raised in a handler propagates
  ok: an exception is handled in a task
